      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING HENRY.\nIn argument and proof of which contract,\nBear her this jewel, pledge of my affection.\nAnd so, my Lord Protector, see them guarded\nAnd safely brought to Dover; where inshipp’d,\nCommit them to the fortune of the sea.",
