      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "WINCHESTER.\nStay my lord legate; you shall first receive\nThe sum of money which I promised\nShould be deliver’d to his Holiness\nFor clothing me in these grave ornaments.",
